<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>大渴 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%A7%E6%B8%B4/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 16:45:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%A7%E6%B8%B4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>重治法：论大渴 大汗 大吐 大泻 阴阳脱</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-6-zhongzhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 16:41:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-6-zhongzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“重治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;大渴、大汗、大吐、大泻、阴阳脱&lt;/strong&gt;等危急重症的重剂救治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病出非常，非轻淡可奏功，必用大剂——石膏数两至斤，人参数两至斤——以顿挫病势。然此乃一时权宜之计，中病即止，不可执为常法&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>霸治法：论大渴 大吐 大泻 大满 发背痈肿</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-2-bazhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 13:25:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-2-bazhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“霸治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;大吐、大泻、大满、大渴、发背痈肿&lt;/strong&gt;等危重急症的峻猛治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病至危殆，死亡顷刻，不可用王道缓图，必以大剂攻邪逐毒之药，单刀直进，摧荡扫除&lt;/strong&gt;，方能力挽狂澜。</description></item></channel></rss>